**Android:** in `android/app/build.gradle.kts` set `minSdk = 24`. On 5.1.0/5.2.0, also add this to the root `android/build.gradle.kts`, above `evaluationDependsOn(":app")`. Without it the APK build fails at `checkDebugAarMetadata`:

